│ (15 min) (30 min) (45 min)       │
│ (1 hour) (2 hours) (3 hours)     │
│                                  │  24
│ Custom                           │  sub-label 14 semibold grey   NEW
│     Hours         Minutes        │
│       0             15           │
│ ▕     1      │      30      ▏    │  selection band (approved wheel)
│       2             45           │
