- **Order for the Home round (agreed with Apurva 2026-11-11):** (1) research + Codex critique of the building blocks (`docs/renders/2026-11-11-home-blocks-review/`, no render) → (2) main thread judges the findings, Apurva agrees the blocks → (3) render run: several options of the agreed blocks with the real design system, 390 and 360 × 640, self-audit, then a Codex critique of the renders → (4) Apurva picks → decision recorded → (5) build run (Home states, kit, PRD, 10-hour cap) → phone check → release PR with `[deploy]`.
- [ ] **Availability at most 10 hours:** the hours wheel goes 0–10 (today it grows without end); at 10 h minutes are 00 only. Goes into the Home run (app-logic, PRD §5.5, kit, tests).
- [ ] **Availability only between 7 AM and 11 PM (Apurva, 2026-11-10 — later):** what the doctor sees when opening the app or setting availability outside these hours, and whether a duration may run past 11 PM (cap it, or show the latest end). Decide the copy and behaviour later; not in this release.

